      "kind": "grammar",
      "title": "har glemt: have forgotten",
      "text": "\"Du har glemt den\" is \"you have forgotten it\": \"har\" plus a form of the verb that ends in -t (glemt). This is how Norwegian says what has happened and still matters now.",
